      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "scene_setup"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T03",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "The publicity team asked about vegetable yields, but this is a building-design study. We are primarily measuring the temperature in occupied rooms immediately beneath the roof during hot afternoons.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Chỉ số chính là nhiệt độ phòng sử dụng ngay dưới mái vào buổi chiều nóng.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T04",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The apparent temperature drop looked impressive, until facilities told us they had changed the air-conditioning schedule that same week. We cannot attribute the whole change to the planting.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Tuần so sánh đầu không phù hợp vì lịch điều hòa cũng thay đổi.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T05",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The measurements also need to distinguish the surface of the roof from the air in an occupied room. A roof can become cooler without every person inside noticing an equal difference.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Mái lạnh hơn chưa chắc nhiệt độ không khí trong phòng giảm cùng mức.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T06",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "That makes the trial a test of building performance, not a competition to grow the biggest plants.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Đây là phép thử hiệu quả tòa nhà, không phải cuộc thi trồng cây lớn nhất.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T07",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "We need an area exposed to similar sunlight but without planting. A nearby section of the same roof is much more defensible than a room on the ground floor.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Nhóm nên dùng phần mái gần đó chưa trồng làm đối chứng.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T08",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "The catalogue makes tall flowers look appealing, but our planting beds are shallow and dry out quickly. We should choose species that can cope with limited soil and periods without watering.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Cây cần chịu được đất nông và khô, không chỉ đẹp hoặc cao.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T09",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "We can add a shaded area on the graph showing the period with altered air conditioning.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Có thể đánh dấu giai đoạn lịch điều hòa bị thay đổi trên biểu đồ.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T10",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "Even if the rooms are cooler, a design that requires daily watering may not be practical. We must report irrigation and maintenance needs alongside the temperature figures.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Báo cáo cần nêu nhu cầu nước và bảo dưỡng bên cạnh mức giảm nhiệt.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T11",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "The room sensors were calibrated and kept in fixed positions. Their readings will be the primary evidence about occupants’ conditions.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Cảm biến trong phòng đã hiệu chuẩn sẽ là bằng chứng chính.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T12",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "A good control should be similar enough that the remaining difference is plausibly caused by planting, not by the building fabric, shading or the behaviour of the occupants.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Khu đối chứng phải đủ giống để tách ảnh hưởng cây khỏi cấu trúc nhà và hành vi người dùng.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T13",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "The photo diary is attractive and shows how the garden developed, but it tells us little about actual thermal performance. It belongs in the visual appendix.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Nhật ký ảnh chỉ dùng phụ lục minh họa.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T14",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "Please agree on the units before anyone starts combining the readings from different instruments.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Cần thống nhất đơn vị trước khi gộp số từ nhiều máy đo.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T15",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "Keep the initial energy figures only with a prominent warning that the building schedule changed. We should not compare them directly with the later weeks.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Giữ dữ liệu tuần đầu kèm cảnh báo vì lịch tòa nhà thay đổi.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T16",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "The moisture probe failed twice during installation. Please collect a complete new series rather than smoothing the missing days into a neat curve.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Cần đo lại độ ẩm đất vì đầu dò từng hỏng hai lần.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T17",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "Before drawing a recommendation, we should check whether the species have roots that might damage waterproofing. The best thermal result would still be unsuitable if the roof became unsafe.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Cần xét rễ cây có làm hỏng lớp chống thấm không, không chỉ kết quả nhiệt độ.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T18",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "I will record the watering routine so that another campus could repeat the trial.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Tôi sẽ ghi lịch tưới để nơi khác có thể làm lại thử nghiệm.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T19",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "Remove staff telephone numbers from the shared dataset. We need a rota for watering, but the research team does not need everyone’s personal details.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Loại số điện thoại cá nhân khỏi bộ dữ liệu chia sẻ.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T20",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "We should be able to explain both the environmental effect and the maintenance cost without claiming that one small roof represents every building in town.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Nhóm cần đánh giá hiệu quả và chi phí bảo dưỡng, không khái quát quá mức.",
